  "summary": "Рабочее дерево чистое, кроме четырёх нужных файлов. Публикую.\n\n```json\n{\"version\":1,\"taskId\":\"f40347ef-5d08-4e0a-98f2-85b5767cbfa9\",\"commandId\":\"publish-1\",\"operation\":\"publish\",\"headSha\":\"fa6ee5f21306772e461e99b5ad5f8c4a194eef68\",\"message\":\"Cup recess and themed flag in HoleSceneBuilder\\n\\nThe cup was a flat dark disc: no flag, no depth. buildCup now returns one\\ncup assembly group with the mouth marker, a back-faced liner sunk by the\\ncapture depth, a floor disc, a flag pole and a pennant whose cloth colour\\ncomes from the course theme. Geometry and material caches are shared as\\nbefore (an open-ended cylinder and a unit triangle join them) and both are\\ndisposed by the builder; result.dispose also clears the nested group.\\n\\nThe theme id reaches the builder through HoleRuntime, which Game passes\\ncourse.themeId. Keeping the parts in a child group leaves the hole mesh\\ncount unchanged. Tests cover the recess, the flag placement and colour,\\nthe default-colour fallback and the per-colour material cache.\"}\n```\n\nЖду результат worker.\n\n",
